sequenceDiagram
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant CM as controller-manager<br/>Single Replica, Leader Elected
    participant DS as Datastore<br/>(In-Memory)
    participant Prom as Prometheus API<br/>Metrics Source
    participant EPP as EPP Metrics Endpoint<br/>SA Token Auth
    participant Target as Scaling Targets<br/>(Deployments/LWS/HPAs)

    Note over CM: Startup - Leader Election<br/>60s lease, 50s renew, 10s retry

    rect rgb(219, 234, 254)
        Note over K8s,CM: Controller Watch Loops
        K8s->>CM: ConfigMap events
        CM->>DS: Update runtime config
        K8s->>CM: HPA events
        CM->>DS: Update HPA state
        K8s->>CM: InferencePool events (v1 + v1alpha2)
        CM->>DS: Update pool state
        K8s-->>CM: ScaledObject events (conditional, KEDA)
        CM-->>DS: Update ScaledObject state
    end

    rect rgb(220, 252, 231)
        Note over CM,Target: Saturation Engine Loop
        CM->>Prom: Query utilization metrics<br/>(HTTP)
        Prom-->>CM: Metric values
        CM->>EPP: Query EPP metrics<br/>(epp-metrics-token auth)
        EPP-->>CM: EPP metric values
        CM->>DS: Read pool & HPA state
        DS-->>CM: Current state
        Note over CM: Compute optimal replica count<br/>(Kalman filter + saturation algo)
        CM->>K8s: PATCH Deployment/scale<br/>or HPA annotations
        K8s-->>CM: Scale acknowledged
    end

    rect rgb(254, 243, 199)
        Note over CM,Target: Scale-from-Zero Engine Loop
        CM->>DS: Check for zero-replica pools
        DS-->>CM: Pools at zero replicas
        Note over CM: Detect incoming traffic<br/>via dynamic client
        CM->>K8s: PATCH Deployment/scale<br/>(scale up from zero)
        K8s-->>CM: Scale acknowledged
    end

    rect rgb(243, 232, 255)
        Note over CM,Target: Coordinator (Experimental)
        Note over CM: GPU rebalancing decisions<br/>via plugin architecture
        CM->>K8s: LIST Nodes, ResourceQuotas
        K8s-->>CM: Cluster GPU state
        CM->>K8s: PATCH target scales
    end

    Note over CM: Health & Metrics Endpoints
    CM-->>CM: :8081/healthz (HTTP, no auth)
    CM-->>CM: :8081/readyz (HTTP, no auth)
    CM-->>CM: :8443/metrics (HTTPS, TokenReview+SAR)
